(6248394, 924203, 61084, '<td valign="top">The finger in the frame ruined it...sorry. IT would have been a much better shot with a tighter crop on just the dominoes and the falling motion. Will be voting later in the week. Good luck.</td>', 'The finger in the frame ruined it...sorry. IT would have been a much better shot with a tighter crop on just the dominoes and the falling motion. Will be voting later in the week. Good luck.', '2010-12-08 02:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
