(6248476, 923502, 23394, '<td valign="top">incredible shot.  would have cropped out the face and ball cap, though, as they are visually competing and not adding anything that the hand doesn''t already represent.</td>', 'incredible shot.  would have cropped out the face and ball cap, though, as they are visually competing and not adding anything that the hand doesn''t already represent.', '2010-12-08 05:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248478, 923848, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but could use a little more blur.  just a little.</td>', 'nice idea, but could use a little more blur.  just a little.', '2010-12-08 05:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248481, 924201, 23394, '<td valign="top">i know getting this shot set up wasn''t automatic, and technically, it''s fine all the way around.  but, it''s not in the same class as the images where you have to hold the camera or hope that the real world is going to give you something that works.</td>', 'i know getting this shot set up wasn''t automatic, and technically, it''s fine all the way around.  but, it''s not in the same class as the images where you have to hold the camera or hope that the real world is going to give you something that works.', '2010-12-08 05:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248484, 923554, 23394, '<td valign="top">you nailed this technically.  aesthetically, there''s just too much light and too much highlights.  overall, it feels sterile and doesn''t feel very dynamic.  if there had been a strong range of colors, this would have rocked.</td>', 'you nailed this technically.  aesthetically, there''s just too much light and too much highlights.  overall, it feels sterile and doesn''t feel very dynamic.  if there had been a strong range of colors, this would have rocked.', '2010-12-08 05:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248487, 924261, 23394, '<td valign="top">the background totally robs this image of its potential.  my first impression was "wah?!"  it took too long for the fire to come through.</td>', 'the background totally robs this image of its potential.  my first impression was "wah?!"  it took too long for the fire to come through.', '2010-12-08 05:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248489, 923399, 23394, '<td valign="top">great idea, but i''m not keen on the composition.  it''s a bit too centered for my taste.</td>', 'great idea, but i''m not keen on the composition.  it''s a bit too centered for my taste.', '2010-12-08 05:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248491, 924147, 23394, '<td valign="top">great idea, but i wouldn''t expect this to do too well here.  maybe if you had gone with a bw tone you could have picked up a few more points.</td>', 'great idea, but i wouldn''t expect this to do too well here.  maybe if you had gone with a bw tone you could have picked up a few more points.', '2010-12-08 05:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
