(6248875, 924186, 96751, '<td valign="top">Primordial.  Reminds me of the movie Alien, where the creature was all the more terrifying because we''d only catch fleeting, disgusting glimpses of it.  Until the end.  When it was just a guy in a lizard suit.  This is before the lizard suit...</td>', 'Primordial.  Reminds me of the movie Alien, where the creature was all the more terrifying because we''d only catch fleeting, disgusting glimpses of it.  Until the end.  When it was just a guy in a lizard suit.  This is before the lizard suit...', '2010-12-08 11:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
