(6248945, 924267, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite so far.  There is something so incredibly elegant about this image.  Perhaps it''s its simplicity, or the delicate parallel, diagonal lines.  I think the dove gray, black, and white color palette also plays a role in it.  But so does his posture - strong, confident, purposeful, heading towards something bright.  And the blur is the melody of this sonata.</td>', 'This is my favorite so far.  There is something so incredibly elegant about this image.  Perhaps it''s its simplicity, or the delicate parallel, diagonal lines.  I think the dove gray, black, and white color palette also plays a role in it.  But so does his posture - strong, confident, purposeful, heading towards something bright.  And the blur is the melody of this sonata.', '2010-12-08 12:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248947, 924061, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely, effective.  The great field of white stabilizes the shot.</td>', 'Lovely, effective.  The great field of white stabilizes the shot.', '2010-12-08 12:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
