(6248951, 923471, 96751, '<td valign="top">Another fave.  This would be on my front page.  The colors are GLORIOUS, and the shadows, delicious.</td>', 'Another fave.  This would be on my front page.  The colors are GLORIOUS, and the shadows, delicious.', '2010-12-08 12:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248954, 923538, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a truly odd image.  That hand is so unexpected and obtrusive.  I can''t decide if that''s good or bad.  But it appears to be from a different genre.  The bird is sensational - the translucence of its wings is sublime.  Then there are the ghostly branches, and the powerful glow of the sun.  The someone appears to be flipping a bird to the bird.  ????<br/> <br/>This is either brilliant or demented.  Good work is often like that.</td>', 'What a truly odd image.  That hand is so unexpected and obtrusive.  I can''t decide if that''s good or bad.  But it appears to be from a different genre.  The bird is sensational - the translucence of its wings is sublime.  Then there are the ghostly branches, and the powerful glow of the sun.  The someone appears to be flipping a bird to the bird.  ???? This is either brilliant or demented.  Good work is often like that.', '2010-12-08 12:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
