(6254211, 923288, 50695, '<td valign="top">I found it crammed into one of the slots of the toaster oven, a page from my Shadow comic from 1944, back when something seriously dangerous was going on and we needed a hero no matter how dark. And here I was thinking I didn''t need toaster ovens any more, or comics, or heros. But when you see a hero like this, materializing from the shades, composed of the very forms you fear most, then you realize how important he''s always been... ready or not.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I found it crammed into one of the slots of the toaster oven, a page from my Shadow comic from 1944, back when something seriously dangerous was going on and we needed a hero no matter how dark. And here I was thinking I didn''t need toaster ovens any more, or comics, or heros. But when you see a hero like this, materializing from the shades, composed of the very forms you fear most, then you realize how important he''s always been... ready or not. Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2010-12-14 23:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254214, 924147, 50695, '<td valign="top">amazing transformation of meaning into beauty.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Art Gallery<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/></td>', 'amazing transformation of meaning into beauty. Posthumous Art Gallery ', '2010-12-14 23:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254215, 923692, 50695, '<td valign="top">the dancer became the dance<br/> <br/>Posthumous Art Gallery<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/></td>', 'the dancer became the dance Posthumous Art Gallery ', '2010-12-14 23:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254216, 923726, 50695, '<td valign="top">Eventually, they all depart, the aunts, the uncles, the jingles, the window shoppers, the smells of cinnamon, the wisps of smoke, and the overloud conductor who whisks them all away.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Art Gallery<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Eventually, they all depart, the aunts, the uncles, the jingles, the window shoppers, the smells of cinnamon, the wisps of smoke, and the overloud conductor who whisks them all away. Posthumous Art Gallery ', '2010-12-14 23:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254217, 924283, 50695, '<td valign="top">a dog is the engine of its own happiness, as proven by this experiment in stop-motion imaging. Note how certain things, in certain light, on certain dream-flush days, cannot be stopped.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Art Gallery<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/></td>', 'a dog is the engine of its own happiness, as proven by this experiment in stop-motion imaging. Note how certain things, in certain light, on certain dream-flush days, cannot be stopped. Posthumous Art Gallery ', '2010-12-14 23:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254218, 924044, 50695, '<td valign="top">you caught her saying no in a world of questions<br/> <br/>Posthumous Art Gallery<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/></td>', 'you caught her saying no in a world of questions Posthumous Art Gallery ', '2010-12-14 23:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254219, 924241, 50695, '<td valign="top">The robot sleeps, his circuits spread across fields of optical fiber. The breeze blows time backwards. The density of matter loses faith in certain arrangements... and sound escapes his funnel ears. We see the echoes of his music.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Art Gallery<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/></td>', 'The robot sleeps, his circuits spread across fields of optical fiber. The breeze blows time backwards. The density of matter loses faith in certain arrangements... and sound escapes his funnel ears. We see the echoes of his music. Posthumous Art Gallery ', '2010-12-14 23:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254220, 923538, 50695, '<td valign="top">freedom is unknown to angels, yet we would fill the sky with them.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'freedom is unknown to angels, yet we would fill the sky with them. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2010-12-14 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6254221, 924100, 50695, '<td valign="top">There is no end: you can see it in his face, if you could see his face, which has blurred into tears. I had a story to tell you but it''s already over.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Art Gallery<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/></td>', 'There is no end: you can see it in his face, if you could see his face, which has blurred into tears. I had a story to tell you but it''s already over. Posthumous Art Gallery ', '2010-12-14 23:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
