(6254380, 923756, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Qiki:</b></div><hr/><i> Motion blur, or just OOF? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>There were plenty of motion blur entries in the missed focus challenge. I was told by others that blur is blur, so it''s fair in my book. Definitely under appreciated.</td>', 'Originally posted by Qiki: Motion blur, or just OOF?  There were plenty of motion blur entries in the missed focus challenge. I was told by others that blur is blur, so it''s fair in my book. Definitely under appreciated.', '2010-12-15 00:37:33.000000', NULL, 0),
