(6254400, 924177, 90098, '<td valign="top">I just bought the 10-24mm and a uv filter along with a 2-stop nd filter (didnt buy the one I wanted anyway) I took the filters off because it was too dark to focus at that time, then they fell out of my hand and into the now roaring tide.  I was pissed.  that was 70 bucks right there.  Then somehow my new cybersync transmitter fell out of my bag in the craziness.  another 60 or so bucks right there.  I still have to order a new one.  Would have been worth it if I had gotten the ribbon though ;)</td>', 'I just bought the 10-24mm and a uv filter along with a 2-stop nd filter (didnt buy the one I wanted anyway) I took the filters off because it was too dark to focus at that time, then they fell out of my hand and into the now roaring tide.  I was pissed.  that was 70 bucks right there.  Then somehow my new cybersync transmitter fell out of my bag in the craziness.  another 60 or so bucks right there.  I still have to order a new one.  Would have been worth it if I had gotten the ribbon though ;)', '2010-12-15 01:02:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6254401, 923283, 62357, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2010-12-15 01:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
