(6254503, 924164, 114233, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=23394" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Skip</a> was right... not the normal DPC favourite type of shot. It is almost abstract and as such it was not well received. That low score is crazy. Keep up the good work you have done lately.</td>', ' Skip was right... not the normal DPC favourite type of shot. It is almost abstract and as such it was not well received. That low score is crazy. Keep up the good work you have done lately.', '2010-12-15 02:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
